  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nWhen you're 28, science discovers a drug that stops all effects of aging, creating immortality. Your government decides to give the drug to all citizens under 26, but you and the rest of the \"Lost Generations\" are deemed too high-risk. When you're 85, the side effects are finally discovered.\n\nHowever, you can purchase this pill on the black market. You have to weigh the pros and cons. You're also taking a risk because you are high risk as you're older than 26 years of age.\n\nYou know that this pill will allow you to live until you're 85. That's a longer life than most people get.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 9,
  "reference_text": " \n\nHowever, the side effects are pretty serious. These side effects kick in once you turn 85 years old and they involve muscle atrophy, frequent diarrhea and nausea as well as headaches.\n\nYou weigh the pros and cons. You want to live as long as possible. You understand there is risk too.",
